id: pm-k6uglj
title: Bound recovery probes by missing-reference rendering retries
description: CodeRabbit full review of e30d553 identifies that recovery workUnits counts dangling references once while each real non-summary probe can rebuild and render a packet once per emitted reference count. Include that bounded multiplicity in the existing recovery estimate so both query-cost refusal and exhaustive verification limits account for it without changing public metadata or weakening packer correctness.
