acceptance_criteria: A real many-reference negative control fails before the repair and proves bounded recovery work afterward; Query-cost and exhaustive verification limits share the multiplicity-adjusted estimate; Small ordinary and canonical-mode retries retain their verified budget semantics; SDK CLI MCP parity coverage and public-surface gates pass without changing assertions deadlines or retry policy
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Multiply recovery work estimates by the actual bounded reference-render passes before applying query-cost and verification limits; summary probes retain one pass. Add a real1100-reference regression with a bounded packer-work guard, legal small-edge and summary controls, and document the policy."
expected_result: "Large full-mode reference queries return honest unavailable budget advice within bounded work, while cheaper valid queries retain verified feasible retries."
actual_result: "The original control exceeds128 packer calls before the repair. Afterward the large full-mode case returns query_cost_limit, while edgeLimit1 and summary controls retain feasible advice under the same guard. All77 linked cases and337 broader cases pass; scoped coverage is100 percent across546 statements367 branches106 functions504 lines. Strict lint four TypeScript projects SDK surface and documentation links pass. Revised hosted acceptance remains the delivery gate."
